  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="fd386bad-fdb8-54dc-b4c9-fc96a78955f1" activityNameId="d92b74aa-6f09-5b6d-887f-b14af598403f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at mill plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at mill plant
All necessary electricity is assumed to be produced on site by diesel generators. Chemical requirements as well as non radioactive emissions to air are averaged over several references describing operation of mills in the early 1980s in North America. Radioactive emissions to air and water as well as non radioactive emissions to water are also averaged values including information from early 1990s. Losses of uranium in milling are arbitrarily assumed 5% of the input uranium. The infrastructure requirement are calculated the production and the lifetime of the model mill.;
UUID: 76021317-f4e1-383f-bfea-c1ad21ca2246
The module includes: the land use for the operation (mostly tailings); diesel generators and  industrial boilers burning light oil; transport of the chemicals and fuels; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water during operation; water use (mining water, but attributed to "unspecified natural origin").
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76021317-f4e1-383f-bfea-c1ad21ca2246.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
